<slide xmlns="https://www.larkoffice.com/sml/2.0"><style><fill><fillColor color="rgb(250,245,240)"/></fill></style><data><shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="34" width="864" height="52"><content textType="body" fontSize="30" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" wrap="false"><p>第一步 · 发现空白：垄断与竞争之间</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="100" width="610" height="100"><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35"><p>古典经济学把竞争当作背景：卖者一多，价格自然落回成本。于是理论只剩两个端点——一家独占，价格最高；无穷多家，价格等于成本。</p></content></shape><line startX="70" startY="262" endX="620" endY="262"><border color="rgb(160,110,105)" width="3"/></line><shape type="ellipse" topLeftX="64" topLeftY="256" width="12" height="12"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(46,32,38)"/></fill></shape><shape type="ellipse" topLeftX="614" topLeftY="256" width="12" height="12"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(46,32,38)"/></fill></shape><line startX="345" startY="244" endX="345" endY="280"><border color="rgb(210,90,86)" width="4"/></line><shape type="text" topLeftX="40" topLeftY="278" width="170" height="30"><content textType="body" fontSize="18" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" wrap="false"><p>垄断：1 家</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="470" topLeftY="278" width="180" height="30"><content textType="body" fontSize="18" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="right" verticalAlign="top" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" wrap="false"><p>完全竞争：无穷多家</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="245" topLeftY="206" width="200" height="34"><content textType="body" fontSize="22" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(210,90,86)" bold="true" textAlign="center" verticalAlign="top" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" wrap="false"><p>少数几家卖者</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="245" topLeftY="286" width="200" height="30"><content textType="body" fontSize="18" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(115,95,95)" textAlign="center" verticalAlign="top" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" wrap="false"><p>没有理论</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="366" width="610" height="84"><content textType="body" fontSize="22" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(210,90,86)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35"><p>古诺的提问：两家卖同一种矿泉水，价格会停在哪里？</p></content></shape><img src="FILE_TOKEN_PORTRAIT" topLeftX="712" topLeftY="108" width="170" height="239"><crop type="ellipse"/></img><shape type="text" topLeftX="680" topLeftY="356" width="236" height="30"><content textType="body" fontSize="18" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" bold="true" textAlign="center" verticalAlign="top" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" wrap="false"><p>安托万·奥古斯丁·古诺</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="680" topLeftY="384" width="236" height="28"><content textType="body" fontSize="18" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(115,95,95)" textAlign="center" verticalAlign="top" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" wrap="false"><p>1801–1877</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="600" topLeftY="414" width="352" height="60"><content textType="body" fontSize="18" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(115,95,95)" textAlign="center" verticalAlign="top" lineSpacing="multiple:1.25"><p>1838 年出版</p><p>《财富理论的数学原理研究》</p></content></shape></data><note><content textType="body" fontSize="14"><p><!-- citation: [1][2] --></p><p>古诺是法国数学家，1838 年出版了《财富理论的数学原理研究》，书里第一次用函数和微分来处理“卖者”的竞争。</p><p>他看到的问题是：当时的理论只会说“人多了价格就降”，但没有人写出只有两家、三家卖者时价格停在哪里。</p><p>可以让学生先猜一猜：两家卖同样的水，价格是接近垄断，还是接近成本？先不给答案。</p></content></note></slide>
